           {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
             {
              "type": "bold"
             }
            ],
            "text": "•lactose = disaccharide (glucose + galactose) - lactase on intestinal cell membranes hydrolyzes it in SI - unabsorbed lactose → colon → bacteria → short-chain FAs + hydrogen gas"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
